{"number":113,"nameArabic":"الفلق","nameTransliterated":"Al-Falaq","nameTranslated":"The Daybreak","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":5,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"113:1","textAr":"قُلۡ أَعُوذُ بِرَبِّ ٱلۡفَلَقِ","transliteration":"Qul aAAoothu birabbi alfalaqi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Say, \"I seek refuge in the Lord of daybreak"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہو، میں پناہ مانگتا ہوں صبح کے رب کی"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"113:2","textAr":"مِن شَرِّ مَا خَلَقَ","transliteration":"Min sharri ma khalaqa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"From the evil of that which He created"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہر اُس چیز کے شر سے جو اُس نے پیدا کی ہے"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"113:3","textAr":"وَمِن شَرِّ غَاسِقٍ إِذَا وَقَبَ","transliteration":"Wamin sharri ghasiqin itha waqaba","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And from the evil of darkness when it settles"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور رات کی تاریکی کے شر سے جب کہ وہ چھا جائے"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"113:4","textAr":"وَمِن شَرِّ ٱلنَّفَّـٰثَٰتِ فِي ٱلۡعُقَدِ","transliteration":"Wamin sharri alnnaffathati fee alAAuqadi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And from the evil of the blowers in knots"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور گرہوں میں پھونکنے والوں (یا والیوں) کے شر سے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"113:5","textAr":"وَمِن شَرِّ حَاسِدٍ إِذَا حَسَدَ","transliteration":"Wamin sharri hasidin itha hasada","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And from the evil of an envier when he envies"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور حاسد کے شر سے جب کہ وہ حسد کرے"}]}]}